//! evaluator/ctfe/ctfe_analysis — CTFE (Compile-Time Function Evaluation) analysis.
//!
//! TS counterpart: `src/evaluator/ctfe/ctfe-analysis.ts` (~194 lines, exports
//! `createComptimeFunctionType` and `analyzeCtfeCapability`).
//!
//! Status: stub. The yo-self port currently performs the analogous analysis
//! inline in `yo-self/evaluator/calls/comptime_fn.yo` (Phase 2/3 wiring),
//! and `evaluator/calls/function.yo` produces the comptime function
//! candidate on demand. Extracting the logic into its own module so the
//! yo-self directory mirrors the TS tree 1-to-1 is a follow-up port.
//!
//! When porting, mirror these TS exports:
//!   - `createComptimeFunctionType` — build a copy of the function type
//!     with all params + return marked `isCompileTimeOnly = true`.
//!   - `analyzeCtfeCapability` — try evaluating the function body against
//!     the comptime type and, if successful, attach the resulting
//!     `functionValueAtCompileTime` to the function value.
